        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I've finished mopping up the Reunion stragglers and reached the waypoint. But we've found the situation in the slums is not what we expected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "The L. G. D. unit guarding the area found no traces of Reunion. I'm going to have to investigate myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "There's been a reduction in the Infected mutants? Is that your doing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "No?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Stay frosty... You never know what danger might be hiding in the shadows."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Don't let your guard down. These Infected are a lot more to handle than your run-of-the-mill Reunion."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Once I finish my work here, I'll send a team to assist you. Keep the channel open. Over and out."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Who's there?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "It's me! Reporting in!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Not you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Nothing. Report in."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Yes, Sir! As ordered, we swept the area!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What did you find?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Nothing! Not a single Reunion footprint to be found!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I told you to be on the lookout for anything unusual!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Oh... Oops. We really don't know this area at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "I mean, according to procedure, we don't come in here until there's a problem so serious we have to tear down a block or something."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I know... The slums don't exist to you, as long as they're quiet."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "When we cut off Reunion, there was a deafening sound coming from this place, and half the residents here vanished."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Look at the toys scattered around our feet... Look at this and tell me there's nothing out of the ordinary."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Was there anything in the plan about evacuating all the residents of the slums?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "...There are a few things out of the ordinary. Most of the buildings in the district have been abandoned or otherwise ruined."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "The streets that are still here are completely empty. Presumably a result of crossfire between Reunion and the locals."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "And there have been a few fires. We have extinguished them. They seem to have been caused by household functions such as heating and cooking."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "All buildings show signs of forced entry, but there is no trace of any resistance from the residents."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "As for Reunion, there's really no sign of them at all. Just... some cleaning residue."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Do you care nothing for the civilians here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "...Sorry, Sir!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What are you apologizing for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "I don't know, Sir!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Whatever... Why should you care about anyone in a place like this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hurry up and send out some teams to lock down the area!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "No one gets in or out. No vehicles either. Reunion or otherwise!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "As for you... You come with me. We're going north."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Yes, Sir!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "(Shh. Don't make a sound!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "(This way. Quickly.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
