            "name": "avg_npc_038"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Very perceptive."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What are you doing?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_015_lmg"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "Preparing to fire!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You should not follow."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Control your subordinates, Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Go find Swire."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer",
        "text": "But, Sir..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Go!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Who sent you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "I do not answer to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You think you can run? Try and I'll arrest you on the spot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You're an unidentified armed element of unknown origin. How do you think the L. G. D. is going to treat you? We might just shoot you dead."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Training a new L. G. D. unit would be a waste of Lungmen's time, treasure, and talent."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "And eradicating the entire L. G. D. would be a crushing blow to the heart of the Lungmen community. You should not take the risk."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hah! Is that threat supposed to scare me? Or should I be thanking you for your concern over Lungmen's future?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Ch'en, the L. G. D. is the face of Lungmen, as well as a pillar of her community, and an exemplary show of her strength."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "And the L. G. D. should stay in its lane."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Don't let it stick its nose where it doesn't belong."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Your threats are really not impressing me. Hurry up and answer the question: where did all the locals go?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You're one tap of this 'alert all units' button away from making an enemy out of the entire L. G. D."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Or I guess you could take a split second to knock away my sword, slice off my arm, and snatch away this transceiver."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Where did all the slum dwellers go?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "We will withdraw from this place. Ch'en, you and I both withdraw. For now, let us not interfere with one another."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "And where is it you think you're going?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "These new-type Infected Reunion is controlling may well interfere with our carefully laid plans."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "We will swiftly remove them for the L. G. D., please do your part to exterminate Reunion's main force."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "If the L. G. D. seeks to actualize its strategic goals, it should focus on its own duties. You must do that which you must do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_038",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
